_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user

# TeamCity is a plugin add-in for TeamCity
_TeamCity*

# DotCover is a Code Coverage Tool
*.dotCover

# AxoCover is a Code Coverage Tool
.axoCover/*
*.axoCoverSettings

